'''3rd Round: Dusk (Hard)''' is one of the possible [[Continuation Stage]]s that derives from [[First Round (Easy)]] that is a part of [[The Proving Grounds]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage. Beating this stage allows the access of two, random [[Continuation Stage]]s. The possible Continuation Stages include:
*[[4th Round: Dawn (Veteran)]]
*[[4th Round: Dusk (Veteran)]]

