==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Snache]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
All enemies here are melee, so long-ranged cats will not be particularly needed unless you want more safety from the enemies here, as one of them, Otta-smack-u, can push through [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] quite quickly in early-game. Thankfully, Otta-smack-u is the only enemy here that is not 150%. As this stage is mostly easier than [[3rd Round: Dawn (Hard)]] excluding the Otta-smack-u, the strategies for there should work here as well. However, more meatshields are recommended for this stage due to the extra pushing power of the Otta-smack-us.

